Subject: [PATCH 07/10] Turn skills into an interactive orbit with per-project
 highlighting

- Logos circle the center in three rings by area; rotation pauses on hover or focus
- Hover, tap or tab to a logo to see its name and group in the center
- Project chips light up the tools each project used
- 'View as list' keeps the filterable grid; static rings with reduced motion
- Short project names in data/projects.json for the chips

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Lbzy3ed4CJxnAN1iky3fxo
